# Kubernetes workload safety

Do not set `privileged: true` unless an existing workload in the same chart
already requires it and the user confirmed.

Add CPU/memory requests when the target cluster or chart already requires them.
Do not invent a full resource policy the project does not use.

Do not `kubectl apply` or Helm upgrade against a production context without
explicit confirmation.

Match existing namespaces, labels, and ingress patterns. Do not add a second
service mesh in-task.
